cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "journalfig: publication-ready matplotlib themes for twelve scientific publishers"
abstract: >-
  Matplotlib themes encoding the figure requirements twelve scientific publishers state, including column widths, font sizes, panel-label conventions, minimum line weights, and accepted file formats, so a figure can be retargeted between journals by changing one string, with a compliance check that reports violations, including typefaces silently substituted by matplotlib.
type: software
